meta {
  name: 09_DeletedParties
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Scenario: The retention window for a deleted sole proprietorship client

    Given an accounting firm with three sole proprietorship clients: one active, one deleted
    inside the retention window, and one deleted outside it
    When a service owner lists the daily leader's authorized parties
    Then the owner of the active sole proprietorship is present
    And the owner of the sole proprietorship deleted inside the retention window is present
    And the owner of the sole proprietorship deleted outside the retention window is absent

  The window is asserted from the deletion date and the configured retention years, not from
  a fixed calendar date, so the scenario stays correct as time passes.
}
